web2ldap is a full-featured web-based LDAPv3 client written in Python.

It is a generic LDAP client which does not make any assumptions about the
tree structure or LDAP schema, and can be used to access and manipulate
LDAP servers without configuring anything.  It includes a schema browser
that displays references and dependencies within an LDAPv3 schema, and
can be customized for LDAP administration use cases.
